{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/2df3d3bd66e0a5fb7b5383964d302671.avif?t=1761997522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras_big/2df3d3bd66e0a5fb7b5383964d302671.avif?t=1761997522 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story shrouded in mystery </strong>- interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1761997522","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1761997522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/f62c373075c789724f6dbcc287e2825c4f448077/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761997522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/f62c373075c789724f6dbcc287e2825c4f448077/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761997522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/2df3d3bd66e0a5fb7b5383964d302671.avif?t=1761997522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras_big/2df3d3bd66e0a5fb7b5383964d302671.avif?t=1761997522 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story shrouded in mystery </strong>- interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","developers":["LyrarmaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/2c74a80a8e26e8338291d29cbc83ad595b8ebcea/header.jpg?t=1761997522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13. \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0435<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13. \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0435<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648620/744225839/1aaa67238454683b7be72896c3739863d9c00fb0/1750433175/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750446397","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648620/744225839/1aaa67238454683b7be72896c3739863d9c00fb0/1750433175/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750446397","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648620/744225839/1aaa67238454683b7be72896c3739863d9c00fb0/1750433175/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750446397","id":257131827,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie480.mp4?t=1750446397","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131827/movie_max.mp4?t=1750446397"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131827/0491d60b598aea28de59114aa4ed18ef1b5825f